TLS certificate directory placeholder (not read by NGINX).

Provide nginx.crt (certificate/chain) and nginx.key (private key) here in the
DEPLOYED configuration directory. NGINX uses the same pair for ports 8443 and
8444. The installer generates a self-signed pair only when neither file exists;
it retains existing certificates, including when the hostname changes.
Keep private keys out of version control. See INSTALL.md for setup details.
